---
description: Check every change against VISION.md and bun run verify
alwaysApply: true
---

Read VISION.md before changing Omastoic. If a change breaks a principle, stop
and change VISION.md first, on purpose.

Follow `.agents/skills/projekt-workflow/SKILL.md` for every change, and read
`AGENTS.md` for the builder contract and hard rules.

`bun run verify` is the check that must pass. It runs the same suite CI runs
and exits 0 or 1. Do not call the work done while it fails.

User-facing text stays plain. Do not fetch at runtime, do not touch a file
that is not provably Omastoic's, and do not add a quote without an author and
an exact source.
